{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261024/photo/bkn-20261024171904143-1024_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261024171904\"/><p>法國商店玻璃被打碎，有人圖踢門闖入。</p><p>鑑於法國當前安全形勢，澳門旅遊局今日(24日)對法國發出第1級旅遊警示，計劃前往該地旅遊或現時身處當地的澳門居民須加強防範安全。澳門旅遊熱線至今暫未收到相關的澳門居民查詢或求助。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T10:03:05.911895+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":116,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T09:19:04+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T12:18:12.623059+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T09:58:18.423168+00:00","content_hash":"b44a76b5f1580e5611391bf649c82e92dbd232c7fc4ee73f6d15a401fa374f1b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-24T10:03:05.911895+00:00","latest_fallback":"minimal","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}